Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Every single night, the lonely boy desperately wished he could completely stop time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.59,0:00:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Then one miraculous day, his deepest wish finally came true across the quiet room.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.38,0:00:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He could suddenly freeze everything around him including falling rain and people in tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.90,0:00:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,At the very beginning, he felt powerful and invincible like an absolute living god.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.54,0:00:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He used his incredible power to easily avoid pain and escape every difficult problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.32,0:00:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But slowly over time, he began to notice something deeply terrifying happening around him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.39,0:00:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Every single time time stopped, someone he truly loved forgot a precious memory forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.54,0:00:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Desperate to fix everything, he stopped time one final time and whispered his truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.06,0:00:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He let time flow again so he could finally stay present with them always.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.90,0:00:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,For the first time in his life, he happily chose to grow older together.
